# The published engine API, produced by `xmake export-api` in a FeatherEngine
# checkout. Everything here is generated and machine-specific -- the metadata
# records the absolute path and git revision of the engine tree it came from --
# so it is fetched or regenerated per checkout, never committed. See
# examples/README.md.
